# Claude — 本地 agent 状态全忽略。四处例外是项目级产物，随仓走：
# verify-pacman（验证 harness）、pr-pacman（本仓 PR body 契约；名字刻意
# 不叫 pr——个人级 skill 同名优先级压过项目级，叫 pr 会被全局 /pr 盖掉）、
# hillclimb（评测数据：输入集、判分口径、跑分）与云端会话启动 hook
# （settings.json 注册 + hooks/session-start.sh 装依赖）。
# 个人覆写仍走 settings.local.json（上方已忽略）。
# hillclimb 的 trace、report.html、trajectory、progress 是派生/体量面，仍忽略。
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/verify-pacman/
!.claude/skills/pr-pacman/
!.claude/hillclimb/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/workflows/
.claude/hillclimb/*/baseline/traces/
.claude/hillclimb/*/report.html
.claude/hillclimb/*/trajectory/
.claude/hillclimb/**/progress.txt
.codegraph/

# Tool-local state (design bridge, diagram/scratch tooling) — machine-local, never committed
.agent-native/
.archify/
.commandcode/

# playwright MCP session dir
.playwright-mcp/

# playwright test artefacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
# Lane process files (#1199): lane threads draft PROGRESS.md / BLOCKED.md at
# the worktree root. Root-anchored so same-named docs in subdirectories stay
# unaffected.
# plan.md (#1203): pacman plan-step handoff — the daemon writes it outside the
# repo checkout; a root plan.md is always a leak (gate: scripts/lane-file-gate.mjs).
/PROGRESS.md
/BLOCKED.md
/plan.md
